G Function: fileinfo
Categories:
  1 lines_in_file
    * zero lines	[single]
    * one line		[property notempty,oneline] [single]
    * two lines		[property notempty,twoline] [single]
    * longer		[property notempty,longfile]
  2 order_of_file
    * Not applicable
    * in alphabetic order	   [if notempty] [single]
    * in reverse alphabetic order  [if notempty] [single]
    * random order		   [if notempty] [property normal]
  3 empty_lines_in_file
    * zero empty lines		  [if not(notempty)] [single]
    * one empty line at beginning [if (notempty)and(not(oneline))] [single]
    * one empty line at end	  [if (notempty)and(not(oneline))] [single]
    * many empty lines		  [if longfile]
  4 number_of_words
    * zero words	[property nowords] [single]
    * one word		[if notempty] [property oneword] [single]
    * two words		[if notempty] [property twowords] [single]
    * many words	[if notempty] [property wordful]
  5 number_of_sentences
    * zero sentences	[single]
    * one sentence	[if ((wordful)or(twowords))or(oneword)] [single]
    * two sentences	[if (wordful)or(twowords)] [single]
    * many sentences	[if wordful]
  6 hyphens
    * no hyphens 
    * mid word hyphens		[if wordful]
    * end of word hyphens	[if wordful]
    * beginning of word hyphens [if wordful]
    * end of line hyphens	[if wordful]
  7 quotes
    * no quotes 
    * quoted words		[if wordful]
  8 apostrophes
    * no apostrophes
    * apostrophe ess		[if wordful]
    * elision apostrophe	[if wordful]
    * ess apostrophe		[if wordful]
  9 other_punctuation
    * no punctuation
    * sentence ending punctuation only	[if wordful]
    * different punctuation		[if wordful]
  10 most_frequent_word
     * zero occurrences		[if nowords]
     * one occurrence		[if ((oneword)or(twowords))or(wordful)]
     * two occurrences		[if (twowords)or(wordful)]
     * many occurrences		[if wordful]
     * over 100 occurrences	[if wordful] [single]
EndFunction;
